X.TP
X.B \-
XGive a usage summary.
X.TP
X.B \-s
XRun silently;
Xdon't give the summary of data at the end.
X.TP
X.B \-v
XVerbose (default).
X.TP
X.B \-o
XOrder the strings in alphabetical order.
XThe strings will be stored in the same order in the data file
